{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21090","headline":"春蝉 · 元稹","name":"春蝉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我自东归日，厌苦春鸠声。\n作诗怜化工，不遣春蝉生。\n及来商山道，山深气不平。\n春秋两相似，虫豸百种鸣。\n风松不成韵，蜩螗沸如羹。\n岂无朝阳凤，羞与微物争。\n安得天上雨，奔浑河海倾。\n荡涤反时气，然後好晴明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}